%% Route stage machine — arbitrage_v2/routes.py STAGES, paper.py step(), real_routes.py record_step()

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> entered : open_route() + funding debit + asset credit
    entered --> awaiting_transfer : buy_a (real) / n.a. (paper enters at steam_locked)
    entered --> steam_locked : paper_entry.enter() progress event
    awaiting_transfer --> awaiting_transfer : finish_entry
    awaiting_transfer --> steam_locked : transfer_a (sets next_eligible_at)
    steam_locked --> awaiting_steam_sale : partial sell_a / paper partial fill
    steam_locked --> steam_wallet : full sell_a / paper full fill
    awaiting_steam_sale --> steam_wallet : remaining quantity sold
    steam_wallet --> return_item_locked : buy_b (spends steam_wallet, sets return unlock)
    return_item_locked --> awaiting_dmarket_sale : transfer_b (real) / paper waits then sells
    awaiting_dmarket_sale --> awaiting_dmarket_sale : partial sell_b
    awaiting_dmarket_sale --> awaiting_settlement : final sell_b credits dmarket_*
    awaiting_settlement --> [*] : resolve (completed / liquidated / write_off) -> outcome record
    entered --> [*] : cancel (real, unused plan only)

    note right of awaiting_settlement
      resolve requires: confirmed=true,
      pending_operations==0, no held assets,
      steam_wallet==0 (or residual written_off),
      a recorded source-market debit, and
      for "completed" both Steam conversions
      plus destination proceeds.
    end note

    note left of steam_wallet
      CSFloat-only stages exist in STAGES but
      are unreachable from the grow flow:
      awaiting_csfloat_sale, csfloat_pending,
      awaiting_payout.
    end note
